    "text": "Se engel brohte \u00feis gewrit of heofonum and lede hit on uppan Sanctus Petrus weofud on Rome.\nSe \u00fee \u00feis gebed sing\u00f0 on cyrcean, \u00feonne forstent hit him sealtera sealma.\nAnd se \u00fee hit sing\u00f0 \u00e6t his ended\u00e6ge, \u00feonne forstent hit him huselgang.\nAnd hit m\u00e6g eac wi\u00f0 \u00e6ghwilcum uncu\u00feum yfele, \u00e6g\u00f0er ge fleogendes ge farendes.\nGif hit innon bi\u00f0, sing \u00feis on w\u00e6ter, syle him drincan.\nSona him bi\u00f0 sel.\nGif hit \u00feonne utan si, sing hit on fersce buteran and smere mid \u00fe\u00e6t lic.\nSona him kym\u00f0 bot.\nAnd sing \u00feis ylce gebed on niht \u00e6r \u00feu to \u00feinum reste ga, \u00feonne gescylt \u00fee God wi\u00f0 unswefnum \u00fee",
